<https://legal.dz/resource/presidential-decree/2003-07-19/03-07#art_62_para_0> a dzdoc:Paragraph ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/presidential-decree/2003-07-19/03-07#art_62> ;
