<https://legal.dz/resource/presidential-decree/2003-07-19/03-07#chp_3_subsec_1> a dzdoc:Subsection ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/presidential-decree/2003-07-19/03-07> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/presidential-decree/2003-07-19/03-07#chp_3> ;
